      "title": "Cold Master Contain · 接线与边界",
      "properties": {
        "text": "COLD：只读取你选择的完整已保存 master；无模型／采样／旧 Stage 依赖。\nLoadVideo 需选择自己的文件，默认占位不可直接运行。\nCONTAIN：保留全画面，等比例缩放后黑色留边；明确改变几何，不是无损像素。\n已有 master 是真实接线依赖，不靠节点摆放保证先保存。\n完整 SDR、零起点 24fps，帧数不变；复制 master 音频包并核 PCM/PTS。\n确认开关默认 false；确认后只写新文件，不重跑生成或覆盖 master。\n失败：postprocess_failed，成片出口阻断；master_video 独立出口保留原片。\n预览和回执不代表人工画质／听感通过。"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "RADAR r6 / v1.93.0: editable native-saved example.\nRead this folder README before queueing. Choose YOUR legal source, VAE, reference names and completed Stage/SHA.\nReference producers must match device/precision; the demonstrated reference sampling used --cpu-vae --fp32-vae.\nSampling saves complete stages; decode separately with normal GPU VAE. EAV is report_only; Relay remains external.\nFull LOW4/HIGH4 and its final separate decode were human accepted for one fixed 5-second case, not all materials.\nCold has no LOW sampler and was not additionally GPU sampled. Full/Contain master modules are templates.\nPartial LOW audio is NOT frozen. Voice/image anchors in the accepted test came from one source, not two independent people.\nExplicit new-file confirmation is OFF in public save templates; no source media/models/cache are distributed."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "COLD：只读取你选择的完整已保存 master；无模型／采样／旧 Stage 依赖。\nLoadVideo 需选择自己的文件，默认占位不可直接运行。\nCONTAIN：保留全画面，等比例缩放后黑色留边；明确改变几何，不是无损像素。\n已有 master 是真实接线依赖，不靠节点摆放保证先保存。\n完整 SDR、零起点 24fps，帧数不变；复制 master 音频包并核 PCM/PTS。\n确认开关默认 false；确认后只写新文件，不重跑生成或覆盖 master。\n失败：postprocess_failed，成片出口阻断；master_video 独立出口保留原片。\n预览和回执不代表人工画质／听感通过。"
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
